window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A sweeping six-book urban fantasy series that will have you devouring the book like a bloodlust-fevered vampire drinking from the vein. This is the second boxset in the series.</b></p> <p><b>Seven Princes of Hell have risen</b></p> <p><b>Seven Vindix, holding seven magical stones, are foretold to defeat the devils.</b></p> <p><b>But the champions of Earth are nowhere to be found.</b></p> <p>Meredith’s job is to find the other <i>Vindix</i>.</p> <p>Easy?</p> <p>Absolutely not.</p> <p>The Ordo Aeternum has it out for the seeker witch and the Ringmaster has revealed herself to be more dangerous than ever.</p> <p>Yes, Meredith’s and Tobias’s enemies are powerful, but thankfully, their loved ones are too for they’ll need every helping hand they can get, and a whole lot of luck, to find the <i>Vindix</i> before the Princes of Hell take over our world.</p> <p><i>This series is a complete urban fantasy series with multiple POVs, three featured M/F romances, deadly enemies, and sky-high stakes. If you like the found family aspect of Vampire Diaries, the slow burn and intense romance of the Fever series, and the action of Supernatural, you’ll love the Coven of Shadows and Secrets Series.</i></p> <p><b>Series Tropes:</b></p> <p>Dark artifact hunters/secret societies</p> <p>Demon hunters</p> <p>Slow burn romance</p> <p>Soulmates</p> <p>Grumpy x Sassy</p> <p>Forbidden love</p> <p>Found family</p> <p>Shifters/vampires/witches/fae/mages</p> <p>7 deadly sins and epic adversaries</p> <p>Series HEAs</p>"; 
